exports[`renderMarkdown > matches the snapshot for a report with flaky jobs, capped at the top 5 per category 1`] = `
"## Veedor CI report — octocat/hello-world

**Total wasted spend: $2.19** across 200 runs analyzed (2026-07-10 to 2026-08-09, ~30.0 days) — projected **$2.19/month** if this trend holds.

> **Confidence levels:** _Confirmed_ = the same commit was retried and passed — hard evidence. _Likely_ = a failure was followed by a pass on the *next* commit pushed to the same branch within 60 min (push-to-retry) — a strong signal, but not proof: the "fix" could also have been a real code change rather than a flake.

### Confirmed flaky

_Evidence: same commit, retried and passed._ Total: **$2.08** (89.50 min).

| Job | Runs | Flaky | Rate | Wasted min | USD |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| unit-tests | 20 | 12 | 60.0% | 62.50 | $0.50 |
| e2e-safari | 10 | 3 | 30.0% | 18.00 | $1.44 |
| windows-integration | 15 | 2 | 13.3% | 9.00 | $0.14 |

### Likely flaky

_Evidence: push-to-retry pattern within 60 min._ Total: **$0.11** (43.10 min).

| Job | Runs | Flaky | Rate | Wasted min | USD |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| self-hosted-load-tests | 4 | 1 | 25.0% | 40.00 | $0.08 |
| lint | 30 | 1 | 3.3% | 2.10 | $0.02 |
| docs-build | 30 | 1 | 3.3% | 1.00 | $0.01 |

**Combined: $2.19** (132.60 min) across both categories.

<sub>Generated by veedor-ci on 2026-08-09.</sub>"
`;

